text = "You think the world is a puzzle, but it’s really a game of patience. It’s in the numbers you ignore. Look at what you’ve overlooked, and you will see it.
Here’s a clue, but only for those who deserve it:

 “I’m not visible, but I’m always there. I start with an end, and I end with a start. I hold your fate, though I am never in sight. Find me.”"
